Some questions came to mind:
Are you faster than the troll?
Do you have any tamed critters left and/or the ability to acquire
more.

If yes, then bring some sufficiently powerful monsters to the Troll
level and let the pets kill it.  Trolls are only LVL 7 so even a large
cat/dog will attack it.  They'll even dispose of the corpse for you!
You probably won't need to polymorph anything to get a strong enough
critter but if you're stuck with kittens then use a polymorph trap.

Another option is, of course, a rubber chicken.  Just make sure Nalzok
didn't vaporize your gloves.  However, if the troll managed to pick up
a stoning cure (potion of acid, etc.) then it'll be able to get
another zap at you.

By the way, congratulations on not dying to the troll during the first
encounter!

